#
# The media writes reference/rest/golden.sh records as media-writes.tsv over
# media-writes.sql's attachments: updates and deletes of /wp/v2/media/<id>,
# each sent with its body as every identity and the database put back after
# each. A delete without force answers 501 as MEDIA_TRASH is off; a body that
# names `featured_media` or `meta` is not ported.
